# Cite-ready software citation for Coticula.
# GitHub "Cite this repository" reads this file. No DOI is registered yet.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Coticula, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "Coticula: a touchstone harness for PDE understanding"
abstract: >-
  Coticula is a small understanding harness for PDE surrogates. Four exams
  (Predict, Conserve, Counterfactual, Explain) score whether a model has
  grasped the dynamics of viscous Burgers (1D) and heat (2D), not just
  interpolated training trajectories. v0.2 adds a 48-item Exam 4 set with
  rule-based (non-LLM) grades, residual-vs-L2 and counterfactual-sensitivity
  diagnostics, and a short paper-style writeup. Reports contain only
  measured numbers; missing checkpoints stay not_trained.
authors:
  - family-names: Pathan
    given-names: Shehbaz
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-12"
url: "https://github.com/shehbaz0101/coticula"
repository-code: "https://github.com/shehbaz0101/coticula"
keywords:
  - Coticula
  - PDE
  - surrogate
  - Fourier neural operator
  - PINO
  - understanding harness
